 ### Data Structures
-*   **Camera Intrinsic Matrix ($K$):** $3 \times 3$ matrix for each view.
-*   **Global Pose:** $[\mathbf{r}_i, \mathbf{t}_i]$ where $\mathbf{r}_i$ is rotation and $\mathbf{t}_i$ is translation for image $i$.
